# Every text file is LF, in the index and in the checkout, whatever core.autocrlf says. A Windows
# clone is otherwise CRLF, and rustfmt and the hash check below read that as drift.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Copied by hash (bin/vectors): never converted, on any system.
vectors/canonical-request.json -text
vectors/canonical-request.sha256 -text

# Cargo's lockfile. Regenerated by cargo, never edited by hand.
Cargo.lock linguist-generated=true
